Package: cockpit-sensors
Version: VERSION
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: cockpit-bridge, lm-sensors
Maintainer: ocristopfer <ocristopfer@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ocristopfer/cockpit-sensors
Description: Cockpit module that displays all data reported by lm-sensors
 Provides real-time monitoring of hardware sensors including CPU temperature,
 fan speeds and voltages in the Cockpit web console.
